<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1>Welcome to EduPortal</h1>
<p>A small student portal used to demonstrate common web vulnerabilities and their fixes.</p>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card"><h3>Reflected XSS</h3><p>Try the <a href="/search">Search</a> box.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>Stored XSS</h3><p>Your <a href="/profile">Profile</a> bio and the <a href="/board">Board</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>DOM XSS</h3><p>The <a href="/welcome">Welcome</a> page (reads the URL hash).</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>CSRF</h3><p>Change email on <a href="/account">Account</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>SQLi (easy)</h3><p>The <a href="/login">Login</a> form.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>SQLi (int/adv)</h3><p><a href="/course?id=1">Course lookup</a> &amp; <a href="/courses">Course search</a>.</p></div>
</div>
